cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this software, please cite it, and cite the paper whose idea it
  implements (listed under references).
title: clm-harness
type: software
authors:
  - name: himax12
repository-code: https://github.com/himax12/clm-harness
license: MIT
version: 0.1.0
abstract: >-
  A bash-only coding-agent harness in which the model manages its own context by
  editing a file. An independent implementation of the Context Language Models idea
  for a hosted model.
references:
  - type: article
    title: Context Language Models
    authors:
      - family-names: Shao
        given-names: Rulin
    notes: Rulin Shao and co-authors. The full author list is on the arXiv page.
    year: 2026
    url: https://arxiv.org/abs/2609.37725
    identifiers:
      - type: other
        value: arXiv:2609.37725
        description: arXiv identifier
